# 副簽
(pos:名詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺文件或者表格上面，由另一個人（通常係擔保人或者見證人）喺正簽旁邊加簽嘅動作或者簽名本身
eng:countersignature; countersign
<eg>
yue:呢份合約要擔保人副簽先至有效。 (ni1 fan6 hap6 joek3 jiu3 daam1 bou2 jan4 fu3 cim1 sin1 zi3 jau5 haau6.)
eng:This contract requires a guarantor's countersignature to be valid.
</eg>
<eg>
yue:你喺呢度副簽就得喇。 (nei5 hai2 ni1 dou6 fu3 cim1 zau6 dak1 laa3.)
eng:Just countersign here.
</eg> [end of text]


